(1. Executive Summary & Overview) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
50 674 Td
13 TL
(Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) has emerged as the industry standard) Tj
T* (architectural pattern for grounding Large Language Models \(LLMs\) in external,) Tj
T* (proprietary enterprise knowledge bases. While LLMs exhibit remarkable reasoning) Tj
T* (capabilities, they suffer from two critical limitations: parametric knowledge) Tj
T* (obsolescence and factual hallucinations. In RAG systems, rather than relying solely on) Tj
T* (static model weights, dynamic external documents are retrieved at inference time and) Tj
T* (supplied within the LLM context window as verified evidence.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
0.1 0.2 0.4 rg
50 561 Td
(2. The Document Ingestion & Chunking Pipeline) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
50 545 Td
13 TL
(The ingestion pipeline transforms raw unstructured documents \(PDFs, Markdown, Docx\)) Tj
T* (into clean, searchable vectors. The standard recommended chunk size for) Tj
T* (sentence-transformer architectures is between 500 and 1000 characters, paired with a) Tj
T* (15% to 20% chunk overlap \(typically 100 to 150 characters\). Recursive character text) Tj
T* (splitting is preferred because it respects natural paragraph boundaries, sentence) Tj
T* (stops, and whitespace hierarchy, thereby preserving local context across contiguous) Tj
T* (chunk boundaries.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
0.1 0.2 0.4 rg
50 432 Td
(3. Dense Vector Embeddings) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
50 416 Td
13 TL
(Dense embeddings map semantic textual meaning into continuous high-dimensional vector) Tj
T* (spaces \(e.g., 384 dimensions for all-MiniLM-L6-v2, and 1536 dimensions for OpenAI) Tj
T* (text-embedding-3-small\). Unlike sparse lexical methods like BM25 which rely on exact) Tj
T* (keyword matches, dense vectors capture semantic synonyms, cross-lingual equivalence,) Tj
T* (and conceptual relationships through cosine similarity.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
0.5 0.5 0.5 rg
50 35 Td
(Smart Document Q&A Assistant Benchmark Dataset - Page 1 of 4 - Confidential & Proprietary) Tj
