ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
50 442 Td
13 TL
(Production enterprise systems frequently employ a two-stage retrieval pipeline:) Tj
T* (bi-encoders \(such as all-MiniLM-L6-v2\) rapidly retrieve the top-50 candidate documents) Tj
T* (in sub-10ms latency, followed by a computationally heavier cross-encoder \(e.g.,) Tj
T* (ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2 or Cohere Rerank\) that scores query-document token interactions) Tj
T* (jointly to select the final top-4 context chunks.) Tj
ET
BT
