ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
50 674 Td
13 TL
(Hallucinations in generative AI are broadly classified into two categories: Intrinsic) Tj
T* (hallucinations \(where the generated output directly contradicts verified source) Tj
T* (context\) and Extrinsic hallucinations \(where the output introduces external claims) Tj
T* (that cannot be corroborated nor refuted from the source text\). In mission-critical) Tj
T* (legal, medical, and financial domains, extrinsic hallucinations carry severe) Tj
T* (compliance risks.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
0.1 0.2 0.4 rg
