(8. Prompt Engineering Guardrails for Factual Fidelity) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
50 558 Td
13 TL
(To eliminate ungrounded speculation, production system prompts enforce four) Tj
T* (fundamental constraints: 1\) Absolute domain boundary: The model is explicitly) Tj
T* (forbidden from utilizing prior parametric memory. 2\) Negative rejection protocol: When) Tj
T* (source evidence is insufficient, the model must output an exact fallback message. 3\)) Tj
T* (Atomic citation requirement: Every declarative statement must conclude with an) Tj
T* (immutable citation bracket [Source: X, Page: Y]. 4\) Low temperature setting: Setting) Tj
T* (temperature to 0.0 or 0.1 minimizes token sampling stochasticity.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
0.1 0.2 0.4 rg
50 445 Td
