ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
50 429 Td
13 TL
(Modern RAG quality assurance evaluates pipelines across four core metrics:) Tj
T* (Faithfulness \(is the answer grounded in context?\), Answer Relevance \(does the answer) Tj
T* (address the user query?\), Context Precision \(are retrieved chunks signal-rich?\), and) Tj
T* (Context Recall \(did retrieval capture all necessary background knowledge?\). TruLens) Tj
T* (and RAGAS automate these evaluations.) Tj
